  "details": "Description\n\nSwitching Avatars Has A Chance To Crash The Open Sound Control System Requiring The User To Restart VRC.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nstep 1- open vrchat. step 2- use something like magic chat box. step 3- switch avatars multiple times. to fix- restart/close vrchat and reopen it.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1p1-1937-299983b13b-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-01_18-48-27.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_bf642cce-cc35-468e-9653-b777ee35cb60/1/file)",
